    [x] Multi-Tab Session State Persistence: Persist open tab metadata and active tab index across app restarts via `SharedPreferences`
    [x] Desktop CLI Launch Argument: Handle opening `.sarv` files directly via command-line arguments (`sarvmd <file.sarv>`)
    [x] Distinct File Deduplication for File Copies: Refined tab deduplication in `WorkspaceCubit` and `AppShell` so distinct files (e.g. `sample.sarv` vs `sample (1).sarv`) open in separate tabs regardless of identical score titles or manuscript contents
    [x] Zero-Document Empty Workspace & Welcome Hub (`EmptyWorkspaceView`): Replaced automatic default document reset on sole tab closure with sleek No Document Welcome Hub featuring starter presets, vector mini-staves, recent files history, template browser, and drag-and-drop prompt
