    [x] Implemented Master Engraving **Bracket Cluster Architecture** (`layout.dart`): replaced Russian-doll horizontal bracket sprawl with tight 3.0mm bracket clustering (`connectorLevelSpacingMm`), saving up to 41.6mm of printable notation width
    [x] Added hierarchical outer-column group label positioning via `GroupPlacement.labelOffsetMm`: group labels sit outside all covering connectors in an aligned outer column, accurately tracking child group label extents
    [x] Scoped inner staff descriptor widths strictly to leaf groups with labels in `computeLayout`, preventing standalone section staves (e.g. *Double Bass*) from bloating outer bracket offsets
    [x] Calibrated `GroupPlacementMetrics` to SMuFL/Gould clearances (connector spacing 3.0mm, bracket tick 1.8mm, staff clearance 2.0mm, inner clearance 1.5mm)
    [x] Differentiated Single-Tier layouts (flush connector at 0.0mm, labels outside) vs Two-Tier layouts (displaced connector enclosing inner descriptors)
    [x] Implemented Gould subsequent-system compaction: automatically omits family group names on systems 2+ when abbreviation is empty, reclaiming 20mm–48mm of printable notation width
    [x] Replaced additive level accumulation across vertically disjoint families with row-aware maximum indent calculations
